Third-party software used but NOT included
------------------------------------------

- original-el8 M3 hook, sidecar and rowmap-mix-v1 (Apache-2.0): the DS-V4.1 recipe mounts an unmodified clone at run time.
- b12x (local-inference-lab/b12x, Apache-2.0), master 2cc7f66a; and our fork commit dce2933e with a W4A16 fix, for E3-A16.
- vLLM (Apache-2.0), SGLang (Apache-2.0), FlashInfer (Apache-2.0): used as the container images named in results.jsonl.
- NCCL and nccl-tests (BSD-3-Clause, NVIDIA): NCCL from the images; the example tuner plugin built from the NCCL source.
- perftest (linux-rdma, BSD/GPL dual): host package.
- J-M-Recipes flash_bench.py (MIT): the decode harness behind logs/fabric-data-direct/fused-glm-*.log; not vendored.
- GSM8K test set (openai/grade-school-math, MIT): downloaded at run time, not vendored.
- llama.cpp (MIT), commits 99b95488 and c479922a: built from source for recipes/kimi-k3 (with the patch above); not vendored.
- compressed-tensors (neuralmagic, Apache-2.0) and humming (in vLLM, Apache-2.0): recipes/kimi-k3/vllm/hook converts
  between their 3-bit packing layouts; no code from either is included.

